    "Proposal only; no product, canonical index, or decisions.json change.",
    "Repeated authorization and concurrent-change messages in saveButton share keys because owner, sink, consumer and parameter contract match.",
    "Revision labels are excluded for a separate shared-sink audit; preserve model.revision as a parameter.",
    "API-provided payload.message/payload.error and error.message are runtime content, not literals for this batch.",
    "Key names are candidates under the approved convention; mappings and content still need review before index or product migration."
